  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "**A comical, twisted, parenting romance that requires a miracle!**\n\nA reclusive loner, social misfit, avoidant personality disorder, and best novelist 'Gong-Jeong' is faced with newborn twins?! What a bolt from the blue! Before Gong-Jeong can even blame his mother for leaving the twins behind, he has to deal with the newborns who cry loudly! Gong-Jeong, who is at a loss and hesitating, is helped by his editor friend, Boo Seung-Hyun, who finds a babysitter. That's how 'Igi-Jeok', the god of parenting, appears. Can Gong-Jeong, who hates people so much, team up with Igi-Jeok to raise newborn twins? \n\nA twisted and tumultuous parenting romance where two people who met as fate when they were young raise twins together and establish new understandings about life, life, and human relationships! \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
